+/* The SPU contexts that have reserved a line.
+ * KZ3 patch 1109: a chain of fixed chunks instead of one 8-slot array. Every
+ * live virtual context may hold a reservation (PR #290's test registers 20;
+ * KZ3 runs 5+1 SPUs, their kernels and stack-local job contexts), and a full
